<title>LITHUANIA: SIAULIU BANK GIVES PROFIT DETAILS.</title>
<headline>SIAULIU BANK GIVES PROFIT DETAILS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's Siauliu Bank on</p>
<p>Wednesday gave more details of its 1996 income after yesterday</p>
<p>announcing a 1996 net profit of 3.9 million litas versus 2.9</p>
<p>million litas of losses a year before.</p>
<p>All amounts are in thousands of litas unless otherwise</p>
<p>indicated.</p>
<p>						1996			1995</p>
<p>    Interest income		     7.380		     7.668</p>
<p>    Interest expenses		   3.646		     4.754</p>
<p>    Net interest income		 3.734		     2.914</p>
<p>Net profit from foreign</p>
<p>    exchange operations		 1.464		     941</p>
<p>Net profit from operations</p>
<p>    with securities		     69			  60</p>
<p>    Other operating income	    1.819		     1.255</p>
<p>    Net operating income		7.086		     5.170</p>
<p>    Personnel expenses		  2.152		     1.503</p>
<p>    Depreciation on fixed assets    405			 250</p>
<p>    Other operating expenses	  2.235		     2.504</p>
<p>    Total operating expenses	  4.792		     4.257</p>
<p>Operating result before</p>
<p>    provisions			    2.294		     913</p>
<p>Change in provisions for bad</p>
<p>    and doubtful loans		  1.744		    (3.551)</p>
<p>    Operating result		    4.038		    (2.638)</p>
<p>    Profit tax			    105			271</p>
<p>    Net result for the year	   3.933		    (2.909)</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
